          {
            "text": "Can you give me any farming advice?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Can you give me any farming advice?"
              },
              {
                "type": "random",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 1",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "You can put up to five tomatoes, strawberries, apples, bananas or oranges into a fruit basket, although you can't have a mix in the same basket."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "eSq9pu"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 2",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "There are seven main Farming areas - Elstan's area near Falador, Dantaera's area near Catherby, Kragen's area near Ardougne, Lyra's area in Morytania, Marisi's area in Hosidius, Alan's area in the Farming Guild and"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Oswallt's area in Prifddinas."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "AL-Ji9"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 3",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Supercompost is far better than normal compost, but more expensive to make. You need to rot the right type of item; show me an item, and I'll tell you if it's super- compostable or not."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "e4qNY5"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 4",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Vegetables, hops and flowers need constant watering - if you ignore my advice, you will sooner or later find yourself in possession of a dead farming patch."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "VciAlw"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 5",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "There is a special patch for growing Belladonna - I believe that it is somewhere near Draynor Manor, where the ground is a tad 'unblessed'."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "IoxiZp"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 6",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Hops are good for brewing ales. I believe there's a brewery up in Keldagrim somewhere, and I've heard rumours that a place called Phasmatys used to be good for that type of thing. 'Fore they all died, of course."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "uCQ00_"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 7",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Bittercap mushrooms can only be grown in a special patch in Morytania, near the Mort Myre swamp. There the ground is especially dank and suited to growing poisonous fungii."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "44XA8h"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 8",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "You can buy all the farming tools from farming shops, which can be found close to the allotments."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "RdhCpR"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 9",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Tree seeds must be grown in a plantpot of soil into a sapling, and then transferred to a tree patch to continue growing to adulthood."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "nrQOha"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 10",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "The only way to cure a bush or tree of disease is to prune away the diseased leaves with a pair of secateurs. For all other crops I would just apply some plant-cure."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "eDpExw"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 11",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "You can fill plantpots with soil from any empty patch, if you have a gardening trowel."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "e_VpVj"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 12",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "If you need to be rid of your fruit trees for any reason, all you have to do is chop them down and then dig up the stump."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "XIBLgw"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 13",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Don't just throw away your weeds after you've raked a patch - put them in a compost bin and make some compost."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "1TyGVO"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 14",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "Applying compost to a patch will not only reduce the chance that your crops will get diseased, but you will also grow more crops to harvest."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "apWQQs"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 15",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "If you want to make your own sacks and baskets you'll need to use the loom that's near the Farming shop in Falador. If you're a good enough craftsman, that is."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "qA9e8o"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 16",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "You don't have to buy all your plantpots you know, you can make them yourself on a pottery wheel. If you're a good enough craftsman, that is."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "WIT4Wx"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dialogue 17",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "npc": "You can put up to ten potatoes, cabbages or onions in vegetable sacks, although you can't have a mix in the same sack."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "E1yuyf"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
